CalldataSliceLib::sliceUint256
├── given zero value
│   ├── it should return 0
│   └── it should return offset + 32
├── given max value
│   ├── it should return type(uint256).max
│   └── it should return offset + 32
├── given value at offset
│   ├── it should read from correct position
│   └── it should return offset + 32
└── given sequential reads
    └── it should read each value correctly with advancing offset